0..71 Comment "//! `module-metadata` puts package data on a declaration as attributes."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..155 Comment "//! The attributes give a name and version, a dependency and a toolchain bound,"
156..229 Comment "//! after the manifest format of Cargo. The language registers no package"
230..298 Comment "//! metadata schema. The source refuses its first unknown attribute."
299..302 Comment "//!"
303..378 Comment "//! The checker reads each attribute block on its declaration. It refuses a"
379..414 Comment "//! name with no registered schema."
415..418 Comment "//!"
419..462 Comment "//! - see: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/"
